# Experiment outputs under studies/ are tracked since 2026-10-06 -- summaries,
# configs, metrics, logs and figures (PDF) -- but not what is heavy or
# regenerable: model checkpoints, pickled analyses (rebuilt from the
# checkpoints, and tied to the code that wrote them), PNG copies of the PDF
# figures, and animations.
**/studies/**/*.pt
**/studies/**/*.pkl
**/studies/**/*.png
**/studies/**/*.gif
**/studies/**/*.mp4
.claude/settings.local.json
